						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Thursday, October 05, 2000</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Site Downtime </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Sorry about the downtime we have had the last few days, it was our hosting provider that moved us from NT to 2000 without letting us know anything. And to top it off, it then took them 4 days to get our site back up. Things should actually be faster on a good note.
<br><br>
See You All in Game!!

<br>

							<br>
							 - Anumatu<BR><BR>
							</p>
